rong>Heat Death</strong>, you're supporting the development of <strong>Sol </strong>and helping shape its foundation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo for <strong>Heat Death </strong>is also available. Once <strong>Sol</strong> releases, <strong>Heat Death </strong>will become <strong>free-to-play</strong>!</p>", "short_description": "In the 23rd century, Earth orbit is flooded with debris from constant warfare. Countries, megacorporations, and mercenaries are fighting for control. Take contracts, build your warfleets, and dominate the Earth-Luna system in this realism-focused strategy RPG!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/0aa1a073df50cdb9bd3deb69d60d1b177cb053f0/header.jpg?t=1775384301", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/5e7aec219c8ecb2238d235834c76543506e5b306/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775384301", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/5e7aec219c8ecb2238d235834c76543506e5b306/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775384301", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core CPU 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 1030-class (2 GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard audio</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core CPU 3.7 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1650-class (4 GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></l